# Phase 5 T-U1+U2 review round (opus 2): a question's resolution in Ctrl-O
# after the screen narrows. One question whose text and chosen label are wider
# than 60 columns, answered with `1` at 120 columns; then the window narrows
# to 60 and Ctrl-O opens over the record the resolution was written into at
# 120. fx keeps the rows it composed and lets its row walker wrap a row wider
# than the screen (`ProjectionRowWalker`, full_transcript_screen.zig:3968-4040
# @481104fd); the question is whether xfx cuts them.
gateway p5-transcript-question-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
env TZ=UTC
wait 4
type pick a storage engine
key Enter
wait 3
snap asked
key 1
wait 3
snap answered
key C-o
wait 1.5
snap full-120
key C-o
wait 1
resize 40x60
wait 1.5
snap narrow
key C-o
wait 1.5
snap full-60
key C-o
wait 1
gwlog
